Source: plruby
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), ruby-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/commandprompt/plruby

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-plruby
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-plruby
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ruby procedural language for PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 PL/Ruby embeds the MRI Ruby interpreter as an untrusted PostgreSQL procedural
 language. The package also includes the jsonb, hstore, and ltree transform
 extensions shipped by upstream.
